{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "f3f08ba61cac9c4b7fe581801399df71b62c19b6fd31e075a3e5baabc991d26a", "ja": "†聖装†の乙女たち", "zh": "†圣装†的少女们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a80c0f6d040059c6218ba4270d6dceceb318441fda9e713f684228aecb8aa439", "ja": "ロコ達の作戦は、ゴシックな衣装を着て、世\n界観の雰囲気を体験することだった。ゴシッ\nク衣装のメンバー達に、百合子の妄想はかき\n立てられる。一方の昴も、百合子の好きなも\nのをなんとなく理解し始めるのだった。", "zh": "ROCO她们的作战方案，就是穿上歌德风服装\n来体验这个世界观的氛围。百合子看到成员们\n换上歌德风服装，脑中的幻想更是变本加厉。\n另一方面，昴也开始渐渐理解百合子的喜好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6069c0fb9566c4b7aec4f7233a3e7b961a78f05d244e4519aef12a3a18983e70", "ja": "（昴がユニットの世界観を理解するための方法、\nそれについて、みんなに考えがあるみたいだけど……）", "zh": "（关于可以让昴理解团体世界观的办法，\n大家好像想到了什么点子……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "a01ae01127691cc9b30662fb67ab1c52de7bd3bb82091c2b720794e0333639db", "ja": "わぁ……♪　みんな、とっても素敵！\nよく似合ってるなぁ♪", "zh": "哇……♪大家都好美！\n每个人都很好看喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "7e7809c0acd0ae47a113739e3ba6db444b1157b04eb0f8528605e63f2ff27dcd", "ja": "青羽さん。\n衣装の準備、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "青羽姊，谢谢你帮我们准备服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "c088386252ff00ec29a677d35844fc5531254bc3d535a7ee3adc61fedbf509b3", "ja": "どういたしまして！　本当は、\n本番用の衣装が用意できたらよかったんだけど……。", "zh": "不用客气！不过说真的，\n如果能直接给你们正式演出要穿的服装会更好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "aee06937b0e12e6cccf67be38f8ca61f950b51e2ca94743ea8d4cdb001b967b2", "ja": "ノープロブレムです！　今回は、インプレッションが\n伝わればオッケーなんですから。ね、アンナ？", "zh": "No Problem！这次只要可以传达Impression就OK了。\n对吧，杏奈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "16fd030efcd2999cdd9f2e9fdd579a5f35161cd642c98f2d1db7c16919684c2d", "ja": "ん……この衣装、なら……ゴシックの雰囲気、\nつかみやすいかな、って……。", "zh": "嗯……这套服装……\n应该有助于理解歌德风的氛围……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6c716b03bc4aebf040a9c85331c5d8bcf265d5b1f5492a015f5f3f8c96858894", "ja": "なるほど、まず形から入ろうってことか。\nいいアイディアじゃないか。", "zh": "原来如此，从外表着手啊。\n这个点子很不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "591b08f6dc430f92ecc371923d84001ef715a8a6e1ea0c5825ae72521389a973", "ja": "たしかに、読書よりはオレ向きかも！\n……あっ！　でも、もしかして……。", "zh": "对耶，比起看书，这可能更适合我！\n……啊！但这是不是代表……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "40a08cbb30518b07566bbdb266c5b4a60cdb56aaf12ef36935aa160a776b058f", "ja": "本番の衣装って、フリフリだったり……？", "zh": "正式演出时的服装……会有很多荷叶边……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "0628295aa10f856e5effc0158b7107453186ac0ea2fddf339438c0c1b9477f68", "ja": "それは、試着の時のお楽しみということで。\n楽しみにしててね、昴ちゃん♪　みんなも！", "zh": "这就留到试穿时再揭晓啰。\n你就拭目以待吧，小昴♪大家也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "aab133dc73a6bd873ee2c4224d81111f50305e45e3ef28a456255f1bc2603ec8", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ！　今回の衣装ももちろんですけど、\nユニットの衣装は、絶対昴さんに似合うはずです！", "zh": "不用担心啦！不仅是这次的服装很适合昴，\n到时候团体的演出服，昴穿起来也肯定会很好看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "7b25d75f36d3d626d8b8201b949aa159de07042a359224ea2a3920f7371c44fa", "ja": "本番衣装に袖を通しただけで、\n前世の記憶がよみがえっちゃうかもしれません！", "zh": "搞不好一换上正式演出的服装，\n你就会想起前世的记忆喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "6415343145db9914b402d0efe5c53a0a399791db41a80475f4a2a51dc2733fe5", "ja": "うーん。前世の記憶はわからないけど……衣装に、\n着た人を変えちゃう力があるのは、本当かも？", "zh": "嗯……我是不知道会不会想起前世的记忆啦……\n不过服装……或许真有改变人的力量哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "5cd695746731a1b77e61b58ff080dff447b1d7ea9b292730ba65c19bfedee127", "ja": "えっ、そうなの？", "zh": "咦！是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "0b7f12c1e5f939c645f9d1349c1a700623a6697e0695c3e06d16ff9933b1bffe", "ja": "うん！　たとえばだけど、ジャージを着ると\n「レッスンしなきゃ！」って思うよね？", "zh": "嗯！比方说，只要换上运动服，\n就会觉得「该去练习了！」对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "a944ca253e33d45abc8892bb255a5c9872a617df8847fcae9d39e78971c709be", "ja": "だから、ゴシックな衣装を着たら……\nお人形になった気分に、なれるんじゃないかなぁ。", "zh": "所以换上歌德风服装……\n或许也会感觉自己变成了人偶呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "97ecf7d1339be916ea3877ae5cb99ec295bc522c99be41d6804fd3778a60093b", "ja": "お、お人形の気分かぁ……。\nまあ、おしとやかにしなきゃなんだろうけど……。", "zh": "变、变成人偶的感觉啊……\n唔，是会觉得要端庄贤淑点才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e7ed8b61057008fab5dd052201a84d113d4da285788a9adc32fc5b09a564d51c", "ja": "昴で言うと、野球のユニフォーム着たら\n気合いが入る……みたいな感じなんじゃないか？", "zh": "以昴来说，大概是换上棒球制服就会充满干劲……\n这种感觉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "3f2f312683c732682d31e67615eeaec6a7f05cc6d6511febee2c23ab4b82534a", "ja": "あっ……なるほど！\n{$P$}、さすが！　頭いい！", "zh": "啊……原来如此！\n{$P$}，真有你的！好聪明！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "0c1d9d7d8c7297826305f99d1addfd0087c1383909ca89f040a08685056e2c15", "ja": "青羽さん。この衣装、\n今日1日借りていても大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "青羽姊，\n这套服装今天可以借给我们一整天吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1020_102mis", "source_sha256": "741fbf7f56abd946c33c2ba7ddcc8528faf2a9a1cdbf8f28c29f8942efc24c19", "ja": "もちろん大丈夫だよ。\nみんな、がんばってユニットの世界観を掴んでね！", "zh": "当然可以啊。\n你们要努力理解团体的世界观哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "63c845e16f091455ca08a2458c474fa6410ec90650c4f1d60c7f0fbe8dc1b808", "ja": "えっと、3行目の漢字は『頽廃』って読みます。\nそれで……次が『渾沌』ですね。", "zh": "我看看，第三行的词念作『颓废』。\n然后……下一个是『混沌』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "9f118f38a2056ddd8bd8f1e7da4fb651704fa59695bea17e8d54108d8e1a9799", "ja": "ちょっと待って！　最初の漢字が『タイハイ』で、\n次が『コントン』……と。い、意味わかんねー！", "zh": "等一下！你说第一个词是『颓废』，\n接着是『混沌』……有、有念没有懂啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "43962fdc2e8ca3d518efa36edd7aee64c83ee8d39d98db97f883f666be9d54d9", "ja": "昴さん、無理しないでくださいね……？", "zh": "昴，你别勉强自己哦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "951c64592a5e1b1a82e4390035dcef0c0f7e940fe0d828d7f555317c6dd1595e", "ja": "ああ、大丈夫。小説は無理でも、\n設定資料の単語くらいは読めないとなー。", "zh": "啊，不用担心。就算小说看不下去，\n我至少也要看懂设定资料里的用词才可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1025_025roc", "source_sha256": "4202c4872c2ba501a9245411943189f2abd51eab4d86400e79ac56c590aaf0bb", "ja": "スバル、漢字はトラディショナルでスタイリッシュな\nアートです。文字だと思ってるからいけないの！", "zh": "昴，中文是Traditional又Stylish的Art。\n你就是只把它们当文字看才会不懂的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1026_025roc", "source_sha256": "939d58b54b92fe46a10a79494fcc92b6674465efeba65e83a58088061117eb19", "ja": "フレキシブルに、イマジネーションのままに書けば、\nそれはきっと昴のアートになりますよ♪", "zh": "只要Flexible地将Imagination写下来，\n肯定会变成昴自己的Art唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "22624f31d410224941cd71e450021d51e4c9e6803177cea20bc5a601c307e231", "ja": "えー、そうなのか？\n……記号だと思って書けばいいのかな。", "zh": "哦～是这样吗？\n……只要当成符号写下来就行了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "2d5110d205b6746643b1556adc9ee7eba392c5e6827abef419d7b5a3d9647eb4", "ja": "はい。私も、たくさん難しい漢字を読んでいるうちに、\nなんだかかっこいい字を使いたくなってきました。", "zh": "没错，我自己也是在阅读很多生僻字的过程中，\n不知不觉就变得想用一些很帅气的词句了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "52e61274da014040cf326f6abdde75c4f18c06a6eb70ee49724878b197577478", "ja": "さらさらさら……こんなのはどうでしょうか。\n……『夜露死苦』。", "zh": "（振笔疾书）……像这种的怎么样？\n……『情和义值千金』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1030_024ann", "source_sha256": "80473578b611051abc92d56c02b993b11b1cecc2bceb4858929ae7762cdfb474", "ja": "瑞希さん……それ、耽美じゃなくて……\n暴走族、かも……。", "zh": "瑞希……那个不是唯美……\n比较像是道上兄弟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1031_026yur", "source_sha256": "a3b8044f06dc819d761c13721aa33a91c5398c0257d89f13ddba45dee0ab5d6a", "ja": "ふふっ！　こうして衣装を着ておしゃべりしていると、\nなんだか森の中のお屋敷にいるみたいですね！", "zh": "呵呵！穿着这身服装一起谈天，\n感觉就像在森林中的宅邸里呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1032_047sub", "source_sha256": "c20e7969f9635102e4aaac1550b054a9d9ca23c531522c74fc49ff0399279dfb", "ja": "森の中のお屋敷？\nでもここ、いつもの劇場だぜ？", "zh": "森林中的宅邸？\n这里不是我们再熟悉不过的剧场吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "94a6de0e2cf45e9c44eb0bb86c445d8baf8a9d5d2c91597f091789c110ff228b", "ja": "そうなんですけど、想像が広がるっていうか。\n遠い物語の世界に生きる、まったく違う私たち……。", "zh": "是这样没错，但该说引人遐思吗？让人不禁去想像\n活在遥远的故事当中，与自己截然不同的我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "bf7162abde5ba94d799c70571f6e5f384a6c0767d49b8f4186c49a82f92fa6ff", "ja": "金の縁飾りのついた鏡に、天蓋付きのベッド。\n私と昴さんは天鵞絨のソファに腰かけて……♪", "zh": "那里有镶金边的镜子、附有床幔的公主床。\n我和昴坐在天鹅绒制的沙发上……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1035_047sub", "source_sha256": "5276e67363accaf1d4fdc198fe131a2db9f0dafbef755a1d77ee1bf334006608", "ja": "何言ってるんだか、全然わからないけど……\n百合子って、ホントにこういうのが好きなんだな。", "zh": "虽然我完全听不懂你在讲什么……\n不过百合子，你真的很喜欢这些东西呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1036_026yur", "source_sha256": "0c9ff2738ef025f3a8b132a23057de3804cac70600543ee97510f7726e62b8f1", "ja": "はい、それはもう！\n大好きです！", "zh": "是啊，这是当然！\n喜欢得不得了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1037_p", "source_sha256": "27550a2244be1ff2fa22b1710cca5df0c47ad4df7ef59050453946b2ea7d9784", "ja": "どうだ、昴。\n何か収穫はありそうか？", "zh": "怎么样，昴？\n你觉得有收获吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1038_047sub", "source_sha256": "5f2c1a47c7e37135159c692f9538d66b0c007f665e8afa92eff41c049e44c9ff", "ja": "{$P$}。\nうーん……あるといえば、あった……かなぁ？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n嗯……要说有，应该算是……有吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1039_047sub", "source_sha256": "332cacbea50e1a312394f111b0d1901ef9dc559f80cc716c9a3ae4cd4a21d1d1", "ja": "頽廃？とか耽美？とか、ゴシック？っていうのは、\nやっぱまだよくわからないんだけどさ。", "zh": "虽然颓废、唯美、歌德之类的东西，\n我还是一头雾水。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1040_047sub", "source_sha256": "f02b23b4f127ca1365947b5cd2319f8ab80d55c67db964b60de04bba68a748e2", "ja": "でも、百合子が本当にこういうの\n好きなんだってことは、わかったかも。", "zh": "但是我好像明白了，\n百合子是真的打从心底喜欢这些东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "1481c901fac7f2f71361ea80727454bdd094a397ad9d923abae0eaac386df0c3", "ja": "（少しずつだけど、前進しているな！　百合子風に\n言うと、運命の歯車がゆっくりと動き始めた……かな）", "zh": "（虽然只有一点点，但确实有些进展！套句百合子\n会说的──命运的齿轮开始慢慢转动了……吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
